WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.637
Adverbs of manner tell how something occurs, as in carefully, politely or quickly;

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.685
choose the form that matches meaning.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.310
Complete the report: “The scientist recorded the results blank .” Choose an adverb

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.147
that tells how. Answer: carefully

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.982
Describe how five classroom actions happen using different adverbs of manner.

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:23.837
Carefully is an adverb of manner; it describes how the action happens.
